[Poke:Infinite Lives]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$CA18(#N$CA18),#N$00</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$CA19(#N$CA19),#N$00</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$CA19(#N$CA1A),#N$00</code>
</div>
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$CA19(#N$CA1B),#N$00</code>
</div>

Removes the instructions which would otherwise take a life away, and end the
game when there are none left.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CA18(#N$CA18)</td>
      <td class="instruction">DEC (#REGhl)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CA19(#N$CA19)</td>
      <td class="instruction">JP M,#R$B761(#N$B761)</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CA18(#N$CA18)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CA19(#N$CA19)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CA19(#N$CA1A)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$CA19(#N$CA1B)</td>
      <td class="instruction">NOP</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

[Poke:Infinite Light Years]
<div>
  <code>POKE #R$ADC9(#N$ADC9),#N$C9</code>
</div>

Makes #R$ADC9 return straight away, so that the light years remaining counter
is never counted down.

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ADC9(#N$ADC9)</td>
      <td class="instruction">LD #REGhl,#N$5B39</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

To:

<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr>
      <td class="address-1">#R$ADC9(#N$ADC9)</td>
      <td class="instruction">RET</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
